# Project 1: LLM CLI Assistant

## Overview

A command-line AI assistant powered by Gemini with:

- Conversation memory
- Summary memory
- JSON persistence
- Token and cost tracking
- Typer CLI
- Rich terminal output

## Features

- Chat with Gemini
- Save and load conversations
- Summary memory
- Usage metrics
- CLI commands

## Tech Stack

- Python
- Gemini API
- Pydantic
- Typer
- Rich

## Future Improvements

- RAG
- Vector database
- Function calling
- Tools
